ss=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No problem. I really enjoyed the Giovanelli Factory tour. Plus, the chocolate cookie recipe on the back of the form was a nice touch!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Yes, you and I love sweet things. The employees were so friendly too.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yep. Remember, that one lady helped you down the stairs. That was kind of her.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Absolutely! I also thought the gift shop was nicely organized, and the variety of chocolates ... wow! The prices were good but the lineup at the cashier was terrible. They need more cashiers in the gift shop.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I agree. I liked the taste tests. Caramel chocolate swirl was my favorite.", "time": "22500"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: I prefer to eat dark chocolate. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm also going to write an additional note in the comment section. It says I plan to return with my friends from Cambridge.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Make sure you mention the lineup. Oh, you forgot your name on the top.", "time": "53000"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oops. They only want my first name.  They also ask for my city and my e-mail address. What do you think?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: They plan to send you offers and information in the future. Do you mind?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not at all. I can't say no to chocolate!", "time": "73000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le02ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": 